            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.63

- Cleaner top for the Illness menu: the level now sits in one card colored by how high it is, with the source underneath.
- A trend, when there is one, shows as a small label on that card.
- "Flu rising nearby" is now its own card. Click it to open Trends.
- The open-in-app and actions buttons sit next to the place name.
- The Illness tab's background is dark slate instead of purple, so the level colors stand out.
]]></description>
